<title>JAPAN: Kobe rubber futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Kobe rubber futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kobe rubber futures market is closed for a national holiday on Monday. Trading will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, benchmark May contract was 0.2 yen per kg lower than the day's close at 146.3 yen.</p>
</text>
